        "summary": "update-manicode.ts now exits process after successful update. detectInstaller() refined to check specific paths (.yarn, .pnpm, .bun, node_modules) and returns undefined if unknown, triggering manual update prompt. index.ts awaits readyPromise before CLI init, parallelizing file context.",
