        "text": "When the assistant notices it's running an older version, it now figures out which package manager you originally installed it with and performs the update using that same method, then restarts automatically instead of just telling you to restart yourself. If it can't recognize your package manager, it shows a simple message asking you to update manually rather than guessing wrong. Behind the scenes, it also loads your project files and checks for updates in parallel, so the startup feels slightly faster.",
